# NVIDIA GB10 additions, composed after omarchy-base.packages and
# omarchy-aarch64.packages (omarchy-pkg-defaults aarch64-gb10): what every GB10
# desktop (the DGX Spark, the ASUS Ascent GX10) runs, as DGX OS does. The driver
# is the one install/hardware/nvidia.sh installs for any NVIDIA GPU.
nvidia-open-dkms
nvidia-utils
libva-nvidia-driver
# GPU containers (Docker's NVIDIA runtime and CDI).
nvidia-container-toolkit
# The ConnectX-7 network's RDMA userspace and module loading.
rdma-core
# NVIDIA's GPU profilers.
nsight-compute
nsight-systems
